<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-17T14:45:01.516Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:45:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;A Pakistan-linked handler allegedly orchestrated a railway-track blast in Rajasthan that killed two people and led to two arrests, while a minibus-oil tanker collision in Punjab left nine dead and eleven injured. In Balochistan, a drone strike claimed by a separatist group killed six Pakistani military personnel, and a motorcycle bomb in Bara wounded two civilians. Saudi firms are pursuing a $30 billion energy investment in Pakistan and a Turkish drone order is prompting India to consider expanding its own production, while AI-generated audio falsely linked a Ghaziabad blast to Pakistan-linked proxies. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNQjNXWEQxYjQwdW1vQVN6U1hRWldnaXJKSGEyaXJOc3N0UUREdUtFWHJSX29UZDNsbHlBTERxNWNOUG1YSF9CZlJFN3NwRGlZeDFtcUMxWk1vcXQ1VWQ5Y1A2TlBtSHpVQ21oUU1CSHB0Z1lubVRmRGE4U3h2bVlSOGZzSzlyXzBD?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOckJMckdkdFBXZkItTVJvMXgyUk1MZ2RacTRjMWJXbWE3YmtPa2thTVhfcU96RVNmcUotTERUMlMza0QxMTZwRkhIdWNqenRadVNsY1RwSnNnVURLejk3bDVUQnRHOVAxVzM4YTlFekNUdHUtUXpNUzk1VWt3cTFvNDZIcVp2VDA1N1NQSmdTbkRqSlpncjNiSEVFWjVkU1Bsd0JGNWQ1b3BWYlFsLVJuX2JOV0E0cFFOWTMw0gG_AUFVX3lxTE0zYWZRSmF3T2NBV3FFQmRvT0s0RENBRFJrRjNVN0ZjdXRzeTlNajhLcmtGNWxkWnBjRUZxNmMxWUhwMUJHalhfVGdaX0F4Tk5mTDNpaTRpSW1MaERFSzhqWGZUbzFWTUNYQjFUcUhUVHhOdU1fZk40ZmpYLUdmeDNITU43M3JvV01uWExkb0h4UkNDUHJ1SVdsbDdTQ2RZNnNNMnVnU29tTmQ5WHJFTzluR0RjUFNrdVloQjFIRjA0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE9NcjIwb1Nsa01JMU52aWx1ZFctTnBRT09BM2s4UXpsak9xd25Kc1VJQ2FVYmQzVk1uelFjWVFCdEtVTkozdWhNQlJtS2FPc00?oc=5&quot;&gt;Afghani